返回格式，严格按照以下json格式进行输出，不得包含其他任何无关信息 \n\n{\n  "content": "必填：文字对话内容",\n  "buttons": [\n    {\n      "show_text": "按钮显示文字",\n      "send_text": "点击后自动发送到后台的文字，要求文字简洁，发送内容为指令，不允许包含主语"\n    }\n  ],\n  "resources": [\n    {\n      "show_text": "资料显示名称",\n      "id": "资料唯一ID"\n    }\n  ],\n  "tests": [\n    {\n      "show_text": "测验显示名称",\n      "id": "测验唯一ID"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nYou are an agent. Your internal name is "engagement". The description about you is "5E教学模型 Engagement 阶段智能体".'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '开始学习'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '开始学习'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '开始学习'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '                                   ', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_00_hFi08T1xq9JzI6SANaeK4015', 'function': {'name': 'is_first_learn', 'arguments': '{"user_id": "user_001", "course_id": "session_001"}'}}, {'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_01_G4gyYEfyqohw6Toy2IfL1713', 'function': {'name': 'get_course_detail', 'arguments': '{"course_id": "session_001"}'}}, {'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_02_F076vNHtgfpnGjMyOGpo0475', 'function': {'name': 'get_related_course', 'arguments': '{"course_id": "session_001"}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_00_hFi08T1xq9JzI6SANaeK4015', 'content': '{"result": false}'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_01_G4gyYEfyqohw6Toy2IfL1713', 'content': '{"result": ["", ""]}'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_02_F076vNHtgfpnGjMyOGpo0475', 'content': '{"result": []}'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '                 ', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_00_PJ2y0EhZdKS6iVYCqZ0Y7176', 'function': {'name': 'get_learned_courses', 'arguments': '{"course_id": "session_001"}'}}, {'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_01_c4H5Czq3Dk1y8KsuovRD4168', 'function': {'name': 'get_course_resources', 'arguments': '{"course_id": "session_001"}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_00_PJ2y0EhZdKS6iVYCqZ0Y7176', 'content': 'Error: Missing tool result (tool execution may have been interrupted 